!TemplateSample
Id: A7B3E2D4-8F1C-4A2E-B9D3-5C6F7E8A1B2D
Name: "Sample: blend shapes (morph targets)"
Scope: Session
Description: Demonstrates blend shapes (morph targets) on a model at runtime
FullDescription: |
   This sample demonstrates how to use blend shapes (morph targets) in Stride.
   It shows how to import a model with morph targets, control blend shape weights
   from C# at runtime using BlendShapeWeightScript, and how the BlendShapeComponent
   is automatically added to entities whose models contain morph targets.

   To use this sample, provide your own FBX model with morph targets in the
   Resources folder and add it to the scene.
Group: Samples/Graphics
DefaultOutputName: BlendShapeDemo
